EclipseOS 26.10 live image

This is the Phase 1 preview: a Debian 13 base, X11, openbox and the
EclipseOS branding. The full Plasma desktop arrives in Phase 2.

The live user "eclipse" has no password and passwordless sudo by design,
because a live session cannot store credentials. Do not treat this image as
a secure multi-user system. Systems installed by the Phase 3 installer will
require a real password for the installed user.

No telemetry or background data collection is enabled.
